## 11. Evidence — pre-integration questions answered, post-integration slots EMPTY until a real build

### [CXC-CSL-EVIDENCE] Pre-integration questions (answered by this design pass) and post-integration evidence (EMPTY — never run)

- pre-integration questions answered by this spec: (1) discovery mechanism -> config-manifest, [DD-CSL-DISCOVERY] (open for ratify); (2) validation ordering -> `Config(**dict)` BEFORE `cls(...)`, [CXC-CSL-CONFIG-VALIDATION]; (3) how a config/resolve park becomes visible when no instance exists to `.announce()` -> a status-only publish bypassing the instance-derived path, [CXC-CSL-STATUS-SURFACE]; (4) how park-reason strings compose with the ALREADY-LANDED `capability:`/`ready:` taxonomy -> extend it with `config:`/`resolve:`, never invent a parallel shape, [CXC-CSL-ERROR-TAXONOMY].
- pre-integration questions LEFT open, flagged for David/architect ratify before or during build (not silently resolved): manifest FILE format + per-tenant location ([DD-CSL-MANIFEST-FORMAT]); whether manifest hot-reload is in v1 ([DD-CSL-HOT-RELOAD]); whether a canonical registered-name registry ships with ComposeServer or is always caller-supplied (`open-question-registry-source`, [CXC-CSL-MANIFEST-SHAPE]).
- evidence-loader-module: EMPTY — `composeio/composeserver_loader.py` does not exist on `origin/main` as of this spec's authoring (2026-08-24); this is a build spec, not a report of landed code.
- evidence-config-validation-park: EMPTY — no test has run [CXC-CSL-CONFIG-VALIDATION]'s CSL-V1 acceptance row against real code.
- evidence-resolve-park: EMPTY — no test has run CSL-V2.
- evidence-requires-floor-integration: EMPTY — no test has confirmed the loader correctly threads `unmet_requirements()` through a manifest-driven path (the underlying `unmet_requirements()` mechanism itself IS landed and tested independently; this slot is specifically about the LOADER's own call path, CSL-V3).
- evidence-continuous-rebind-real-capability: EMPTY — no `verify.human` run against a real tenant bus and a real capability arrival has occurred (CSL-V4's human gate).
- evidence-subprocess-pending-real-bringup: EMPTY — no real Phase-0/Phase-1 bring-up has exercised a manifest-declared subprocess-floor plugin through this loader (CSL-V5's human gate).
- evidence-per-tenant-isolation: EMPTY — CSL-V6 unrun.
- evidence-status-surface-real-admin-view: EMPTY — CSL-V7's human gate unrun; no operator has viewed a real `_server/status` payload carrying a config-invalid entry produced by this loader.
- why-empty-matters: per [DX-SPEC-CARRIES-ITS-EVIDENCE], "never run on hardware" (here: never run at all) must be a QUERYABLE PROPERTY, not something a reader has to already know — every slot above is `EMPTY` explicitly rather than simply absent, so a future query against this node can distinguish "not yet built" from "nobody thought to record it."
- status: draft
- status-detail: draft — every evidence slot EMPTY by construction; this spec has not been implemented
- provenance: architect-synthesis
- part-of: [SPEC:CXC-CS-LOADER]
- see-also: [DX-SPEC-CARRIES-ITS-EVIDENCE], [CXC-CSL-ACCEPTANCE]

